 odes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, b
 ut must be typed as one word.\n\nSpike’s love of singer-songwriters on t
 he jazzier side of folk & blues finds a unique outlet in The Get Real Gone
 . In addition to Spike on vocals & guitar\, the band features Dylan Juhan 
