 s a vibe unto itself. They released their self-titled debut in 2025\, a co
 llection of originals and a few choice covers from the world of jazz\, blu
 es\, and poetry. https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3rxVIMq-455o8kD7yTIoEg 
 https://awesomehotcakes.com/ Recommended If You Like: Tim Buckley\, Jayne 
