BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Be Ready Comedy Open Mic - Monday Comedy Workshop & Comedy Open Mi
 c
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260525T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260525T210000
UID:26040430sKqkI87EGLlsxpOWSF1Q
DESCRIPTION:Starting April 6th\, Ok Good Comedy is launching a brand new o
 pen mic at Barrel Proof Lounge. Free to attend!\n\nEvery 1st and Last Mond
 ay of the Month\n\nSchedule: 6–7 PM — Comedy Workshop 7–9 PM — Com
 edy Open Mic\n\nOpen Mic Details: • 5 minute sets - A couple longer spot
