BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tuesdays in the Plaza: The Sun Kings (Beatles Tribute)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260526T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260526T200000
UID:260514PARGMNIoxEObUYoAKBJuJQ
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p
 .m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and hav
 e been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendors
  will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 p
 .m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m.\n\nAbout the band: Enjoy the mu
 sic created by one of the most influential bands of our time. You'll hear 
 many of the Fab Four's \\#1 hits\, B sides and deep tracks - all performed
  with attention to detail duplicating their tight harmonies\, fancy guitar
  work and solid backbeat. In short\, that signature Beatles sound! \n\nBa
 sed in Connecticut\, these 5 lads\, started out a few years back perfectin
 g their music and vocal harmonies as they grew a list of songs now nearing
  100! Performing at special events\, outdoor concerts\, libraries\, restau
 rants and music festivals is the primary focus as their following grows wi
 th each performance. "No wigs\, costumes\, backing tracks or gimmicks here
 .... just 5 guys who sing and play like The Beatles!"\n\nEnjoy some delici
 ous cuisine from one of our Tuesdays in Plaza food vendors starting at 5:0
 0 p.m.:\n\nTacos Don Tacos\n\nHealdsburger\n\nChef Degen\n\nLola's Market\
 n\nPacheco Roasted Corn\n\nTuesdays in the Plaza is hosted by the City of 
 Healdsburg Community Services. A very special thank you to Big John's Mar
 ket for their generous sponsorship.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza
URL:https://healdsburg.gov/335/Tuesdays-in-the-Plaza
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
