DESCRIPTION:Nature Explorers helps families explore the art and science of
  the natural world. \n\nJoin us with an experienced California Naturalist 
 through a variety of programs with hands-on experiences from specimen expl
 oration to “creature features” and nature hunts.  \n\nThis program is 
 held out and about in Mary’s Garden after storytime at 10:30am. \n\nAll 
 ages welcome!
LOCATION:Children's Museum of Sonoma County
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/nature-explorers-saplings-2/2026-05-27/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
