SUMMARY:The Velvet Chapter Prelude to The Bay Area Book Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T220000
UID:260522TvMjUEN5T0uX1azx0INBBA
DESCRIPTION:Prelude to Bay Area Book Festival: Indie Romance & Romantasy a
 uthors\, meet & greets\, vendors\, and bookish bites. Limited tickets.\n\n
 **✧ Event Overview ✧**\n\n**The Velvet Chapter: Prelude to the Bay Are
 a Book Festival is an evening experience centered on romance\, fantasy\, 
 and connection through books.**\n\n**Held at the Hall of the Above in Peta
 luma\, this event brings together authors\, readers\, and curated vendors 
 for a night of discovery\, conversation\, and immersive atmosphere. Whethe
 r you’re coming to meet authors\, explore unique bookish goods\, or simp
 ly enjoy a thoughtfully designed space\, this is a place to slow down and 
 engage with stories in a meaningful way.**\n\n**✧ What to Expect ✧**\n
 \n**✧ Meet the Authors** **Spend time with both local and visiting autho
 rs during dedicated signing windows. Browse their work\, ask questions\, a
 nd connect directly.**\n\n**✧ Author Lineup Schedule** **TBA**\n\n**✧ 
 Curated Vendors** **Explore a selection of book-focused vendors offering c
 andles\, jewelry\, literary gifts\, and more.**\n\n**✧ Interactive Exper
 iences** **Participate in hands-on elements throughout the evening\, inclu
 ding live book foiling.**\n\n**✧ Drinks & Treats** **Additional themed d
 rinks and treats will be available.**\n\n**✧ Event Details ✧**\n\n**
 📍 Hall of the Above** **199 Petaluma Blvd N** **Petaluma\, CA 94952**\n
 \n**🗓 May 28\, 2026** **🕯 4:00 PM – 10:00 PM**\n\n**🎟 FREE 21+ 
 event**\n\n**✧ Attire ✧**\n\n**Guests are encouraged to come dressed i
 n a way that reflects their personal style—romantic\, bold\, or otherwis
 e.**
LOCATION:Hall of the Above
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/the-velvet-chapter-prelude-to-the-bay-are
 a-book-festival-tickets-1987865081972
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
