 e for an evening of wine\, painting\, and community\; all in support of TL
 C's LGBTQ+ youth affirming services. \n\nYou'll create a guided painting 
 of the Sonoma County moonlit sky while sipping wine provided by La Crema W
 inery. No painting experience necessary\, just show up and have fun!\n\nEa
 ch ticket includes two drink tickets and a canvas to take home. All suppli
 es are provided. \n\nChoose the ticketing tier that works for you.\n\n
 📅 Thursday\, May 28 | 5:30–7:30 PM \n\n📍TLC’s Main Campus: 1800
  Hwy 116 N.\, Sebastopol\, CA\n\nGet your tickets!
