DESCRIPTION:Join us **in person** for the **Petaluma Trestle Promenade 
 Now Community Kickoff Event**.\n\nA dedicated group of local residents ha
 s officially launched the *Petaluma Trestle Promenade Now Steering Commit
 tee*. The group’s mission is to transform Petaluma’s deteriorating his
 toric trestle into a vibrant\, iconic riverfront promenade that serves as 
