 ts\, business owners\, and community members are invited to attend the off
 icial project kickoff and status update.\n\nRSVP: https://www.eventbrite.c
 om/e/petaluma-trestle-promenade-now-community-kickoff-event-tickets-198986
 3180338\n\nLearn more at trestlepromenadenow.org\n\nQuestions: info@trest
