BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Caldwell Snyder Artist Reception: Between Day & Night by Gilles Ma
 rrey
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T180000
UID:260518yLA2_v9VhUSEgbYxdXHszg
DESCRIPTION:Caldwell Snyder Gallery is pleased to present Between Day & N
 ight\, an exhibition of new works by acclaimed Parisian painter Gilles Mar
 rey\, with an opening reception on Saturday\, May 30th from 4:00–6:00 PM
  at the gallery’s historic Star Building location in St. Helena. Known f
 or his atmospheric depictions of contemporary life\, Marrey transforms fam
 iliar interiors\, urban streetscapes\, and landscapes into emotionally res
 onant scenes through luminous palettes of violets\, blues\, pinks\, and wa
 rm oranges. His paintings invite viewers to slow down and reconsider every
 day environments with renewed attention and sensitivity.\n\nInfluenced by 
 years of travel throughout the Bay Area and inspired in part by the work o
 f Richard Diebenkorn\, Marrey’s practice explores the relationship betwe
 en structure\, light\, atmosphere\, and lived experience. Trained in Franc
 e during the 1980s\, he developed a distinctive figurative style rooted in
  observation while remaining deeply contemporary in feeling and execution.
  Set within the heart of Napa Valley\, the exhibition offers visitors an o
 pportunity to experience Marrey’s richly layered works in an intimate ga
 llery setting while celebrating the intersection of contemporary art\, pla
 ce\, and atmosphere.\n\nFeaturing live music from jazz pop artist\, Clemon
  Charles and wine generously provided by V. Sattui Winery.\n\nAddress: 132
 8 Main St\, St Helena\, CA 94574\n\n707.200.5050\n\nMonday – Saturday 10
 am – 5pm\n\nSunday 11am – 5pm
LOCATION:Caldwell Snyder Gallery
URL:http://www.caldwellsnyder.com/artists/gilles-marrey
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
