DESCRIPTION:NGI's third annual fundraiser\, whose mission is to put a gard
 en in every home and help teach our communities about food sovereignty!\n\
 nCome groove with Neighborhood Garden Initiative at our third annual Foli
 age Funk Fest fundraiser! This year\, we're getting funky at Permaculture
  Artisans for a day filled with lush greenery\, amazing vendors\, fabulou
 s vibes\, and hosted by two fabulous hosts\, Lexie & Tiffany Hayes! Get r
 eady to dance in the beautiful Sebestapol garden and enjoy live music from
  local artists. Whether you're a plant enthusiast or just looking for a fu
 n time\, this event is perfect for everyone. Don't miss out on this fusion
  of nature and music. All proceeds for the event will go to helping NGI in
 stall more gardens for our community!
LOCATION:Permaculture Artisans
