 ting in this hands-on workshop while creating a small sculptural vessel. W
 orking with locally sourced wool\, you’ll explore how fiber transforms t
 hrough water\, soap\, and movement.\n\n**In this workshop you’ll:**\n\n
 • Learn the fundamentals of wet felting\n\n• Understand how wool fiber
 s bond and shrink\n\n• Practice shaping wool into a three-dimensional fo
 rm\n\n• Create a small felted vessel to take home\n\nAll materials provi
 ded. No experience required.
