UID:260111t4nxx4BGyUCTGqCobTW9jA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a chill evening of live music and good vibes with 
 The Ukulele Ramblers at our happy hour event!\n\nWelcome to Live Music - T
 he Ukulele Ramblers - Open Uke Jam! Join us for a fun-filled evening of li
 ve music and ukulele jamming at Barrel Proof Lounge. Bring your ukulele an
 d strum along with The Ukulele Ramblers\, a talented group of musicians wh
 o will be performing a mix of classic tunes and original songs. Whether yo
 u're a seasoned ukulele player or a beginner looking to learn\, this event
  is perfect for all music lovers. So mark your calendars for Sundays and g
 et ready to enjoy a night of great music and good vibes. See you there! Op
 en Uke jam hosted by your friendly neighborhood Ukulele collective.\n\nBri
 ng your singing voice and your Uke if you've got one\, and enjoy the comfo
 rtable\, welcoming space at Barrel Proof Lounge!\n\n21\\+\n\nLive Music 3-
 6 pm\n\nFree Popcorn!\n\nwww.UkuleleRamblers.net\n\nCheck out www.BarrelP
 roofLounge.com for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
