 and the scenic shoreline of Clear Lake.  Fundraiser Pancake Feed Start you
 r morning at the marina with our Fundraiser Pancake Feed from 8AM – 11AM
 \, benefiting Operation Tango Mike. Come early\, enjoy breakfast\, and sta
 y for a day filled with nostalgia\, community\, and classic craftsmanship.
