BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pedal Fest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T160000
UID:260517sH0rTdmtWk6ZKv2iT4xKOg
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Bicycle Coalition is excited to present Peda
 l Fest in celebration of Bike Month. This free family festival will featur
 e vendors\, demos\, community rides\, races & relays and general bike fun 
 for all!\n\nThe day will start at 10:30 with a bike decoration station fol
 lowed by a Kidical Mass family ride at 11:00\; there will also be group ri
 des from Petaluma\, Santa Rosa\, and other locations.\n\nContests will inc
 lude the longest wheelie\, the longest trackstand\, turtle races (how slow
  can you go?)\, and more!\n\nMultiple bike shops\, clubs\, and teams will 
 be represented...with LOTS of cool bikes and swag to check out! Food and b
 everages available at Old Caz.\n\nOur Presenting Sponsor is SOMO Village\,
  with additional support from Marin Bikes\, Old Caz\, and the Bay Area Air
  Quality District.
LOCATION:SOMO Village\, outside Old Caz Brewing
URL:https://www.bikesonoma.org/events/2026-bike-expo/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
