DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Library Headquarters will host the Regular Libra
 ry Commission meeting and Budget Adoption. The Sonoma County Library Commi
 ssion is an 11-person body responsible for governing the library. Commissi
 oners are appointed by the cities in Sonoma County and the county Board of
  Supervisors. The commission establishes policy\; sets goals and objective
 s\; hires and evaluates the director\; establishes and monitors the annual
  budget\; and exercises such other powers\, consistent with the law to fos
 ter the effective use and management of the library. The commission genera
 lly meets monthly\, with additional special meetings as needed. Meetings a
 re open to the public and recordings are accessible online through
LOCATION:Sonoma County Library Headquarters
