DESCRIPTION:Ready to turn your weekend into a wine-filled adventure?\n\nHi
 t the road for the 2026 Lake County Wine Adventure — two days of tasting
 \, exploring\, and celebrating across participating wineries throughout th
 e county. Cruise scenic backroads\, discover exclusive pours\, and meet th
 e winemakers behind every glass.\n\nVisit wineries along the way to earn e
 ntries into our weekend sweepstakes — the more stops you make\, the more
