BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Illegals  (The Premier Tribute to the Music of the Eagles)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T200000
UID:2605150ii_eO6xREC96ING_kQUAA
DESCRIPTION:The Inn at Occidental is proud to welcome back our Sunset Conc
 ert Series for 2026. Join us on select Sunday evenings as live music fills
  the courtyard and the sun sets over West Sonoma County.\n\nOur outdoor ba
 r will be pouring local wines\, craft beers\, and seasonal spritzes\, with
  a rotating lineup of local food offerings available each night. Please jo
 in us for great music\, great food and wine\, and relaxed summer evenings 
 in the redwoods.\n\nWe will kick off the series with:\n\n**The Illeagles**
 \n\n**Sunday\, June 7 at 6pm**\n\n**ABOUT ILLEAGLES**\n\nWhat do people wa
 nt from a live show? The musicians of Bay Area tribute band ILLEAGLES beli
 eve audiences want to be engaged\, energized\, and singing along from the 
 very first note. Judging by their string of sold-out performances\, they d
 eliver exactly that.\n\nFormed when six accomplished musicians united over
  a shared love of the music of the Eagles\, ILLEAGLES set out to faithfull
 y capture the magic of one of the most iconic bands in rock history. Throu
 gh countless hours of rehearsal and attention to detail\, they have master
 ed the soaring guitars\, rich harmonies\, and timeless sound that made the
  Eagles legendary.\n\nFrom high-energy classics like “Life in the Fast L
 ane” and “Heartache Tonight” to beloved ballads like “Desperado”
  and “Best of My Love\,” ILLEAGLES brings these songs to life with bot
 h precision and passion. The result is a show where audiences quickly find
  themselves singing along from the very first chorus to the final encore.\
 n\nILLEAGLES delivers a high-energy celebration of Eagles music that turns
  every concert into an unforgettable night.
LOCATION:Inn at Occidental
URL:https://www.innatoccidental.com/2026-sunset-concert-series/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
