DESCRIPTION:Grow your blues dancing this June 7 &/or 14! Class will be hel
 d on Sundays\, June 7 and 14 from 1-2:30pm. 1-2pm will be structured class
  and 2-2:30pm will be reserved for class practice/social dancing.  No drop
  ins! You MUST register in advance. Connect\, shuffle\, swivel\, dip and d
 ance with us! These workshops will cover:  Isolations to grow your self ex
 pression and musicality on June 7.  Close embrace blues dancing \\(done ch
 est to chest\, no exceptions\\) on June 14. Classes will be held from 1-2:
 30pm on Sundays\, June 7 and 14. Lesson will be 1-2pm and social dancing/p
 ractice from 2-2:30pm. Bring a partner with you\, or come solo and we will
  pair people up. Single folks and couples are welcome\, alike. If you have
