DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T201500
UID:260519vxTO9E8cOkyTkc4CfDg6Fg
DESCRIPTION:Soulful Roots Rock & Twangishnes: New Copasetics at Redwood Ca
 fe Fri\, June 12\, 6:00-8:15.\n\nDallis Craft (piano\, vocals\, worked wit
 h Bruce Willis\, K.T. Oslin) Tim Eschliman (bass\, Commander Cody)\, Mark 
 Larson (Tele) and Brent Rampone (drums\, Flambeau).\n\nName your price! $2
 0? $15?... $10?\n\nTheir repertoire extends from originals to their own ta
 ke on select material from great artists such as The Band\, Rockpile (Nick
  Lowe & Dave Edmunds)\, Ry Cooder\, Delbert McClinton\, Gary Nicholson\, A
 rthur Alexander\, Richard Thompson\, Buddy & Julie Miller\, Lucinda Willia
 ms\, Taj Mahal\, Dan Hicks\, NRBQ\, Manual Galban\, Doris Troy\, Ike & Tin
 a Turner\, ...Hank Williams\n\nDownload / Stream the album here: https://o
 rcd.co/7ogareg(widget to select your music service)\n\niTunes:https://geo.
 music.apple.com/us/album/twang-ucopia-balanced-diet/1479442917?app=itunes&
 at=11laEk\n\nPandora: https://www.pandora.com/artist/new-copasetics/twang-
 ucopia-balanced-diet/ALkdm7Z95xZ5P26\n\nTidal:https://tidal.com/album/1174
 15704/track/117415709\n\nyes\, june 12 at Redwood Cafe... 8240 Old Redwood
  Hwy\, Cotati\, CA 94931 (707) 795-7868 \n\nA reasonably priced and diver
 se menu along with daily specials that appeal to a variety of diets and ag
 e groups. ... favorites include delicious Linguini al Pesto with Smoked Ch
 icken\, Linguini with Clams\, Hawaiian Burger\, and Salmon Nicoise Salad. 
 Sonoma State Students get a 10% discount all day when you show a valid cur
 rent student ID.\n\n"Roots rockabilly from a wily crew with a load of cred
 its ... Whether kicking it out on originals or covers\, they understand th
 e genre and the groove and deliver accordingly and appropriately." - Midwe
 st Record Recap\n\nSee also https://www.newCopasetics.com\n\n\\-----------
 ------------\n\n#rootsrock #americanrootsmusic #americanamusic #rockabi
 llymusic #twangyguitar #neswcopasetics#semi-acousticmusic #adultalbumal
 ternative #singersongwriter
