DESCRIPTION:SIP\, STROLL & CELEBRATE National Rosé Day with wine\, bites 
 & beats at top Downtown Napa tasting rooms. Let's drink PINK & have some F
 UN!\n\nCelebrate *National Rosé Day* with Tish Around Town in style with
