 free Open Studio event\, held from 10 AM-5 PM on June 6-7 and June 13-14. 
 Known for capturing Sonoma County landscapes with emotion and atmosphere\,
  Corry's work reflects her passion for Plein Air painting and preserving m
 oments in time through art. Guests can meet the artist\, view her latest p
 aintings\, and experience the inspiration behind her creative process. C. 
 Dastur Studio\, located within the Art & Music Gallery\, is handicap acces
 sible.
