DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T170000
UID:260508T02SmVOxukWk3ypNdIb6Ig
DESCRIPTION:Corry Dastur\, of C. Dastur Studios\, is proud to announce tha
 t one of her Plein Aire paintings is the cover art for the 2026 Art at the
