 lness-focused workshop at Montgomery Village. Guests will explore how thou
 ghtfully selected herbs can support relaxation\, digestion\, and everyday 
 balance while creating a custom tea blend to take home. Designed to be bot
 h educational and approachable\, this experience offers a calm\, creative 
 setting to learn simple\, plant-based rituals for daily wellness.\n\nDurin
 g the workshop\, guests will:\n\n\\- Learn the fundamentals of herbal tea 
 blending\n\n\\- Explore herbs that support relaxation\, digestion\, and ov
 erall well-being\n\n\\- Create a personalized tea blend to enjoy at home\n
 \nNo experience is necessary — this workshop is beginner-friendly. The w
 orkshop fee includes all materials\, a custom take-home tea blend\, and a 
 step-by-step guide for continued blending at home.\n\nDetails: Advance reg
 istration required. Workshops are held outdoors (undercover) at Made Local
  Marketplace. Space is limited\, with a minimum of four participants requi
 red. A minimum of 72 hours’ notice is needed for partial refunds.
